<title>USA: FDA-tobacco ruling to come Wednesday or later.</title>
<headline>FDA-tobacco ruling to come Wednesday or later.</headline>
<dateline>GREENSBORO, North Carolina 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The federal judge in the tobacco industry's challenge to U.S. Food and Drug Administration restrictions on marketing and selling cigarettes in the United States will not rule until Wednesday or later.</p>
<p>A taped telephone message to advise lawyers and others awaiting U.S. District Court Judge William Osteen's decision said no ruling would come until at least Wednesday.</p>
<p>Osteen has been considering the matter since February 10, when tobacco company lawyers asked the judge to throw out the federal agency's new rules without a trial.</p>
<p>((-- Miami newsroom, 305-374-5013))</p>
